      <description><![CDATA[<figure><img width="1024" height="467" src="https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?w=1524&amp;ssl=1 1524w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=768%2C350&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=1200%2C547&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=780%2C356&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=400%2C182&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=706%2C322&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w" sizes="(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw" /></figure>Unitree has launched the G1+, an upgraded version of its G1 humanoid robot with six upgrades spanning motion performance, perception, interaction and endurance. The standard model is priced at RMB 95,000 in China, while the G1+ EDU version is available by contacting sales. The G1+ adds two neck degrees of freedom, raises peak shoulder-and-waist motor [&#8230;]]]></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<figure><img width="1024" height="467" src="https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?w=1524&amp;ssl=1 1524w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=768%2C350&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=1200%2C547&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=780%2C356&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=400%2C182&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?resize=706%2C322&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/G1.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w" sizes="(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw" /></figure><p>Unitree has launched the G1+, an upgraded version of its G1 humanoid robot with six upgrades spanning motion performance, perception, interaction and endurance. The standard model is <a href="https://www.ithome.com/1/002/133.htm">priced at RMB 95,000 in China</a>, while the G1+ EDU version is available by contacting sales.</p>
<p>The G1+ adds two neck degrees of freedom, raises peak shoulder-and-waist motor torque by 110% and maximum arm torque by 43%, and reduces heat at the same torque. It also adds a binocular-plus-wide-angle vision system, head touch sensing, external power support, a six-microphone array and dual 10-watt speakers. [<a href="https://www.unitree.com/G1plus/">Unitree</a>]</p>
