      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<figure><img width="1024" height="446" src="https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?fit=1024%2C446&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=300%2C131&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=768%2C334&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=1536%2C669&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=2048%2C892&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=1200%2C523&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=1024%2C446&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=2000%2C871&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=780%2C340&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=400%2C174&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?resize=706%2C307&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?w=2340&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/technode.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/zhipu-scaled.png?fit=1024%2C446&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w" sizes="(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw" /></figure><p>Z.ai <a href="https://m.21jingji.com/article/20260913/herald/4911ab6445d53e05af2ae90557e34017.html">has announced the completion</a> of a combined financing round worth around US$5 billion, including about US$2 billion from a share placement and roughly US$3 billion through convertible bonds.</p>
<p>The company plans to use the funds for next-generation GLM foundation models, a fully self-training system, large-scale training and inference, computing resources and infrastructure upgrades. The plan also covers automated training-data generation and filtering, task environments, long-range reasoning, domestic-chip adaptation and inference optimization. [21Jingji, in Chinese]</p>
